MID_LGV_2_M01_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Tia_m01_001: War. I couldn't have imagined... How many children\nwill be left grieving lost parents?
MID_LGV_2_M01_Tia_m01_002: I feel like I can't do much, but I'm going to work on\nstrategies that could reduce casualties.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Tia_m01: <BLN>I'm going to work on strategies...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Pet_m01_001: A war? A real one?
MID_LGV_2_M01_Pet_m01_002: I mean, I think I'm ready to fight, but... Oh, man.\nMy legs feel like jelly.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Pet_m01: <BLN>A real war...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Hur_m01_001: I'm fine. Aurora, my family, all of them got out of\nDagsion before it was too late.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Hur_m01_002: But, I can't calm down. Knowing we're about to go to\nwar with the Dagdan Empire...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Hur_m01_003: Please be safe. We're all going to survive. No matter\nwhat it takes...
MID_LGA_2_M01_Hur_m01: <BLN>No matter what it takes!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Max_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Max_m01_001: Heh heh HEH! Goin' to war with the empire. This is\nbound to be atrocious!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Max_m01_002: No matter what happens, the Infernal Clown's going\nto give better than he gets.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Max_m01_003: 
MID_LGV_2_M01_Max_m01_004: 
MID_LGV_2_M01_Max_m01_005: 
MID_LGA_2_M01_Max_m01: <BLN>It's kill or be killed.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gol_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gol_m01_001: I betcha I could rout the empire's army on my own.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gol_m01_002: I mean, the temple soldiers back in Dagsion used to\nshrink when they saw me walk past.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gol_m01_003: I'll put a real scare into these soldiers too! Bwahaha!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Gol_m01: <BLN>I can take 'em!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gat_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gat_m01_004: With the return of Emperor Dagda, it appears an\nera of war has begun.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gat_m01_002: 
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gat_m01_005: Dagda the Great is a powerful figure, yes...but a\ndespicable one.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gat_m01_003: 
MID_LGV_2_M01_Gat_m01_006: We've come too far to pull back now. Entrust me\nwith anything you need.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Gat_m01: <BLN>You can count on my aid.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dan_m01_001: I feel so fortunate! An unprecedented conflict is\nkicking up in Dagda...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dan_m01_002: and I am alive and present to experience it up close!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dan_m01_003: I will document everything, virtue and evil alike,\nand weave them into my masterpiece!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Dan_m01: <BLN>How lucky!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fab_m01_001: Dagda the Great does not merely lack any form of\nethics—he deliberately instigated this war.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fab_m01_002: Perhaps it is simply arrogance that drives him... He\nassumes victory. But don't discount base amorality.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fab_m01_003: Most likely it is both in combination, I suppose. The\nsuperlatively vulgar nature of a beast.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Fab_m01: <BLN>Base and beastly.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Esm_m01_001: My mom must be scared, what with Dagda the Great\nstarting this war.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Esm_m01_002: Good thing Fina is so far out of the way. I can't see\nwar coming there anytime soon.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Esm_m01_003: But let's get this thing done with as soon as we can!\nI don't want my mom to worry.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Esm_m01: <BLN>Mom...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Urs_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Urs_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_2_M01_Urs_m01_005: The fact that you're standing here suggests you\nintend to stand against the empire.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Urs_m01_002: 
MID_LGV_2_M01_Urs_m01_006: It's a gamble, but that isn't to say the Vandahl\nTrading Company is averse to such decisions.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Urs_m01_003: 
MID_LGV_2_M01_Urs_m01_007: The greater the risk, the greater the profit, after all...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Urs_m01_004: 
MID_LGA_2_M01_Urs_m01: <BLN>We'll see, won't we?
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sim_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sim_m01_001: Didn't think Emperor Dagda would start a war this \nquick. Guy gets pissed off fast.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sim_m01_002: Cranky as the boss gets waking up, this is next level.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Sim_m01: <BLN>That didn't take long.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lou_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lou_m01_001: My father's on the other side... Even if we come face\nto face on the battlefield, I won't run away.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lou_m01_002: Because my father would rather trade blows with me\nthan see me run from a fight.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lou_m01_003: Even so, I pray we don't meet. If I can help it, I'd\nprefer not to fight him...
MID_LGA_2_M01_Lou_m01: <BLN>I won't run, Father...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fia_m01_001: I can't believe that the Divine Emperor would begin\na war so outright.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fia_m01_002: I knew he was a frightening person when I \nheard the stories about him...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fia_m01_003: But Saramis protects Dagda. Trying to destroy it is\ncompletely insane.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Fia_m01_004: I pray that he reconsiders.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Fia_m01: <BLN>This is insane...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Die_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Die_m01_001: I must now...continue on. I'll do what I need to,\nsimple as that.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Die_m01_002: I was a Har Hali warrior once. I'll be a warrior\nagain, fighting the imperial army.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Die_m01: <BLN>I'll do what I need to.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lor_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lor_m01_001: I've got to fight. I have to...no matter what. Doesn't\nmean I'm not scared though.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lor_m01_002: I mean, we're facing up to the most powerful god\never, that's all. But he wants to kill tons of people!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lor_m01_003: It's just wrong. Completely wrong. I know that the\npriest lady would think so!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Lor_m01: <BLN>I'll fight too...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Set_m01_001: Chaos has broken out in this land—a war between\ngods and humans.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Set_m01_002: I intend to stop the Divine Emperor Dagda, just as\nI once fought the 10 Elites of another time.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Set_m01_003: If she were here, rather than me, I know she would\nmake the same decision now.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Set_m01: <BLN>A war between gods and humans...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Nin_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Nin_m01_001: War is in the air... People will die... Countless\nnumbers of people.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Nin_m01_002: I can fight. I can pray. I sense that both will be\nrequired.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Nin_m01_003: I will do it for all the dead souls—and in memory\nof Yu Phas.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Nin_m01: <BLN>What will be required of me...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Bon_m01_001: This is only the latest in a line of existential crises\nfor the kingdom of Saramis.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Bon_m01_004: This is only the latest in a line of existential crises\nfor the kingdom of Saramis.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Bon_m01_002: Whether it was under the late King Sergio or Your\nMajesty, we have overcome them all.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Bon_m01_005: We have always survived through the guidance of\nthe late King Sergio, then Her Majesty.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Bon_m01_003: I vow to use my expertise as Your Majesty's tactician\nto emerge victorious this time as well.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Bon_m01_006: I vow to use my expertise as a tactician to emerge\nvictorious this time as well.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Bon_m01: <BLN>I vow it.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Tob_m01_001: Yeesh! First the Mosa, now the empire?! How come\neveryone wants to kill us all the time?
MID_LGV_2_M01_Tob_m01_002: Let's eat well and get fired up for battle! Yu Phas,\nwatch over us!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Tob_m01: <BLN>Watch over us!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lil_m01_001: I'd never have thought we'd actually have to fight\nthe empire. Can't say I'm surprised, though.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lil_m01_002: Well, I'm being paid to fight, and I'm not picky about\nwho. I've been ready for war for a long time.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lil_m01_003: And if they're coming to burn down my home,\nthey'll have to go through me first.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Lil_m01: <BLN>Let's take them down.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lys_m01_001: A declaration of war on Saramis is essentially the\nDivine Emperor's death warrant for us all.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Lys_m01_002: I will protect my queen's life...even if I must sacrifice\nmy own to do so.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Lys_m01: <BLN>I will protect my queen!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Buc_m01_001: The army marching on Saramis is far larger than the\nforces involved in the Cydonia Massacre.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Buc_m01_004: The army marching on Saramis is much larger than\nthe forces involved in the Cydonia Massacre.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Buc_m01_002: But milady has overcome many battles, and now\nyou have control over Obsidian.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Buc_m01_005: Even so... The Saraminian forces' might is\nconsiderable, and there are many allies joining them.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Buc_m01_003: So tragedy may be avoided. I am choosing to\nhave faith.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Buc_m01_006: So tragedy may be avoided. I am choosing to\nhave faith.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Buc_m01: <BLN>I'm choosing to have faith.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sci_m01_001: Gods, this is a reckless war. The temples are sure to\nhave dispatched vulkans in droves.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sci_m01_002: Well, we've made it this far together, so I will\naccompany you to the end.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sci_m01_003: Whatever my lady Kalla wishes, I will do. That\nmeans accompanying you.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sci_m01_004: No matter how reckless the war, I will work to\nensure you survive it.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sci_m01_005: I am a power celestial general, and I will protect you\nregardless of what comes.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Sci_m01: <BLN>I will accompany you.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Moo_m01_001: There was no way I was gonna let you leave\nme behind.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Moo_m01_002: I fought in the Heroic Games too! I'm sticking with\nyou no matter how dangerous it is.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Moo_m01: <BLN>No chance!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Mic_m01_001: And now we're at war with Dagda the Great. Can\nyou believe it?
MID_LGV_2_M01_Mic_m01_002: It leaves a bad taste in my mouth, but I'm committed.\nI'll fight till the end.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Mic_m01: <BLN>War has begun.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Oly_m01_001: I've sung many a story of war, but I never imagined\nI'd take part in one.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Oly_m01_002: The person I once was would have been panicking\nabout all this.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Oly_m01_003: However, with everything I went through at the\nHeroic Games, I can stand taller than all others!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Oly_m01: <BLN>I am ready!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Naz_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Naz_m01_001: I never thought the day'd come when I'd fight the\nempire head-on! It's a dream come true.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Naz_m01_002: I don't care how big an army they got. I'll defeat\nevery last one of them!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Naz_m01: <BLN>It's like a dream come true.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sar_m01_001: Saramis managed to repel the Mosa's attack, and\nthen the empire goes and declares war on them.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sar_m01_002: Why is it that the descendants of the People of the\nWhite Egg always suffer so much?
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sar_m01_003: 
MID_LGA_2_M01_Sar_m01: <BLN>One after another...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dai_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dai_m01_001: Heh heh heh, it's war! And that's the perfect time\nfor me to let loose!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dai_m01_002: If I strut my stuff in battle, I bet a certain someone is\nbound to swoon!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dai_m01_003: Oh, but what if I'm too cool on the battlefield?\nWhat if all the women fall for me?
MID_LGV_2_M01_Dai_m01_004: Actually, that'd be great! I'd look even cooler,\nand that would be full-on awesome!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Dai_m01: <BLN>I'm gonna do great!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Hal_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Hal_m01_001: Are we maybe really going to war? Against the\nbiggest country in all of Dagda? That's so scary.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Hal_m01_002: B-but I can't run away when everyone else has\ndecided they're gonna fight.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Hal_m01_003: I'm not the only one who's scared. I've got to be\nbrave, like everyone else!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Hal_m01: <BLN>I've got to be brave!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Guj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Guj_m01_001: When I heard the Divine Emperor had woken up,\nI thought it was just some big story...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Guj_m01_002: But it was true. Just goes to show, you never know\nwhat could really happen in life—ever!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Guj_m01_003: So I plan to just keep on enjoying life as long as\nI can! Ha!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Guj_m01: <BLN>You never really know...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Yan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Yan_m01_001: So Lord Solel is deceased, and a tyrannical\nemperor has taken the throne.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Yan_m01_002: In short, Lord Dagda is back—already unleashing\ntorrents of blood across the land.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Yan_m01_003: I shall face that flood and still those red waves!\nI shall mete out death for the imperial villains!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Yan_m01: <BLN>Death for the imperial villains!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Iio_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Iio_m01_001: It's been over five hundred years since the Divine\nEmperor first entered his slumber.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Iio_m01_002: There are few demigods alive today who knew\nhim then. And no humans, of course.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Iio_m01_003: So, I wonder... How many soldiers serving him\nnow feel any true loyalty to him?
MID_LGA_2_M01_Iio_m01: <BLN>As things stand...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Pep_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Pep_m01_001: We find ourselves appalled! A great ruler awakens,\nonly to seek the destruction of Saramis?
MID_LGV_2_M01_Pep_m01_002: We had planned to leave this land after one year.\nSo we promised Father.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Pep_m01_003: But we must stay longer. The outcome of this\nbattle will affect even far-off Brigid.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Pep_m01: <BLN>We have decided!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Noc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Noc_m01_001: You know, I love fighting. But I hate killing.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Noc_m01_002: Still, war demands it, I guess. None of us have\nany other choice now.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Noc_m01: <BLN>It's just how it is...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sop_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sop_m01_001: I can't imagine a world without Lord Solel. I can't\nbelieve he's no longer with us!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sop_m01_002: And I can't believe he'd commit the crimes that\nthe Divine Emperor accused him of!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Sop_m01_003: I've got some thinking to do. But for now, I'm just\ngoing to pray a whole lot for Lord Solel.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Sop_m01: <BLN>I refuse to believe it.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Cat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Cat_m01_001: I hadn't anticipated that such a huge war could\nbreak out so suddenly. It'll be...historic.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Cat_m01_002: It's a great time for my services! A war like this\nwill need a knight of my high caliber!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Cat_m01_003: I will fight for the weak, who deserve a champion!\nMy reputation will be on the ascent!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Cat_m01: <BLN>This is where I come in!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ned_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ned_m01_001: A war between mighty Saramis and the empire...\nMaybe this was inevitable.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ned_m01_002: Their battle doesn't change my path. A true warrior\nmust grow stronger. These fights will shape me.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Ned_m01: <BLN>So, it's finally here.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Zac_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Zac_m01_001: Dagda's really screwed everything up—waking\nfrom his slumber, going on this rampage!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Zac_m01_002: A big god like him, going after us puny little\nhumans? What's he so afraid of, the coward!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Zac_m01: <BLN>This is messed up!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Maj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Maj_m01_001: Solel's dead and gone... Damn it! I'm so\nfreakin' angry!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Maj_m01_002: None of this stupid stuff would've happened if they\nmade ME ruler of Dagsion!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Maj_m01_003: I always knew he was a nothin' kind of guy!\nFlaky too! But this is just too much!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Maj_m01: <BLN>I can't believe it!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ven_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ven_m01_001: Woo-hoo! War! Now the great General Benditz\nwill prove his excellence at last!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ven_m01_002: I like a war between people a whole lot more. But\nthis here is a war of gods versus people...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ven_m01_003: Blast it! Merchants and all the high-ranking fools\nwill profit from this. But it's my time. MINE!
MID_LGA_2_M01_Ven_m01: <BLN>I've been waiting for this!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ini_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ini_m01_001: The Divine Emperor is scary as they come. I hear\nhe executed a priest who raised an objection...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ini_m01_002: He won't have many people around left to serve\nhim if he kills people over little things like that.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Ini_m01: <BLN>How terrifying...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Jas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Jas_m01_001: I wonder if any of my old comrades are fighting in\nthis war. I'd hate to think we'd be on opposite sides.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Jas_m01_002: I guess it's just the life of a mercenary. There's a\nlot you just have to accept with this work.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Jas_m01: <BLN>I hate to think about it, but...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ale_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ale_m01_001: I owe the queen of Saramis a great deal.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ale_m01_002: I fought for Jurah as a wing soldier. But now, I am\nsimply a knight here, proud to serve!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Ale_m01_003: When I was very young, my parents taught me to\nhelp those who have taken time to help you.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Ale_m01: <BLN>I will fight!
MID_LGV_2_M01_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Cen_m01_001: I knew a man whose tongue was ripped out by\nDivine Emperor Dagda.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Cen_m01_002: We weren't close, but he was a smart man and we\nsometimes played board games together.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Cen_m01_003: He did nothing wrong. Yet, petitioning the\nDivine Emperor was the end of his life.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Cen_m01: <BLN>A truly awful thing...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Kir_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Kir_m01_001: {SetColor=Gray}I bet the war will wreak havoc on traders... Maybe\nthe Vandahl Trading Company will go under...{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_2_M01_Kir_m01_002: {SetColor=Gray}Hooray for that! Serves the rogue right!{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_2_M01_Kir_m01_003: {SetColor=Gray}Ugh, what have I come to... Can't do anything but\ncurse him to damnation...{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGA_2_M01_Kir_m01: <BLN>I wonder...
MID_LGV_2_M01_Nuz_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_Nuz_m01_001: We cannot allow Dagda's first act after awakening be\nto overrun the land of Damascar.
MID_LGV_2_M01_Nuz_m01_002: I will fight to the last of my strength to repay the\ndebt I owe to the queen of Saramis.
MID_LGA_2_M01_Nuz_m01: <BLN>I must repay my debt.
MID_LGV_2_M01_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_B01_m01_001: Doesn't seem like us new recruits have much of a\nchance of making it out of this one alive.
MID_LGV_2_M01_B01_m01_002: But we have Yu Phas looking out for us in the\nunderworld, right?
MID_LGV_2_M01_B01_m01_003: In that case, maybe it won't be so bad. Yeah...I gotta\nsee the positive side of things.
MID_LGA_2_M01_B01_m01: <BLN>We'll turn out alright.
MID_LGV_2_M01_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_B02_m01_001: My queen has chosen the path of no surrender\nagainst Dagda the Great's declaration of war.
MID_LGV_2_M01_B02_m01_002: As a warrior of Saramis, would I feel the same if it\nwere about any of Prince Dyan's commands?
MID_LGA_2_M01_B02_m01: <BLN>History is full of what-ifs.
MID_LGV_2_M01_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2_M01_B03_m01_001: We've defended this land for a long time as the\nShield of Dagda, and lost many lives in the process.
MID_LGV_2_M01_B03_m01_002: My father, my brother, and even my child all died for\nthe cause. Yet I always believed it to be a noble duty.
MID_LGV_2_M01_B03_m01_003: Only now do they say "we don't need a shield."\nThose double-crossing bastards!
MID_LGA_2_M01_B03_m01: <BLN>We can only be pushed so far!
